                                                "sense_id": "d4bd3bec-374c-3115-b61a-ccc70ce73a5f",
                                                "text": "And now, in stead of mounting barbed steeds / To fright the souls of fearful adversaries, / He capers nimbly in a lady's chamber[…]."
                                            }
